---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Support Kavu Preservation | Nagayakshi Temple">
  
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="support-hero">
    <div class="support-hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="support-hero-content">
      <h1>Preserve the Sacred Kavus</h1>
      <p>Help protect and restore the seven ancient Sarpa groves for future generations</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The Mission -->
  <section class="mission-section">
    <div class="support-container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-label">Our Sacred Mission</span>
        <h2>Why Kavu Preservation Matters</h2>
      </div>
      
      <div class="mission-content">
        <div class="mission-text">
          <p class="mission-lead">
            The seven sacred Sarpa Kavus are not merely temple property—they are the living homes 
            of the naga deities, the very foundation of this ancient shrine's spiritual power. 
            Without these Kavus, the temple loses its essence.
          </p>
          <p>
            For generations, these sacred groves have provided shelter to the Divine Nagas, acting 
            as portals where devotees' prayers directly reach the serpent deities. But decades of 
            neglect, natural degradation, and the pressures of modern development have threatened 
            their integrity.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Our mission is urgent and clear:</strong> Restore all seven Kavus to their 
            pristine sacred condition before it's too late. This requires replanting native trees, 
            creating protective boundaries, conducting purification rituals, and establishing 
            permanent maintenance systems.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="mission-stats">
          <div class="stat-card">
            <div class="stat-number">7</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Sacred Kavus</div>
            <div class="stat-detail">To be fully restored</div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="stat-card">
            <div class="stat-number">3</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Kavus Restored</div>
            <div class="stat-detail">Through devotee support</div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="stat-card">
            <div class="stat-number">4</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Remaining</div>
            <div class="stat-detail">Need your help now</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


</Layout>

<style>
/* Support Page Styles */
.support-hero {
  position: relative;
  min-height: 60vh;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: 
    linear-gradient(rgba(82, 14, 9, 0.88), rgba(82, 14, 9, 0.88)),
    url('/images/temple1.jpg') center/cover;
  padding: 8rem 2rem 4rem;
  text-align: center;
}

.support-hero-overlay {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(212, 165, 116, 0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);
}

.support-hero-content {
  max-width: 800px;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 10;
}

.support-hero h1 {
  font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
  font-size: 4.5rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: white;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
  text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
}

.support-hero p {
  font-size: 1.4rem;
  color: var(--gold-light);
  line-height: 1.6;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.support-container {
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 2rem;
}

.section-header {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 3rem;
}

.section-label {
  display: inline-block;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  color: var(--gold);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.section-header h2 {
  font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
  font-size: 3rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--laterite-red);
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

/* Mission Section */
.mission-section {
  padding: 6rem 2rem;
  background: var(--bg-base);
}

.mission-content {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
  gap: 4rem;
  align-items: start;
}

.mission-lead {
  font-size: 1.3rem;
  line-height: 1.9;
  color: var(--laterite-dark);
  font-weight: 500;
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}

.mission-text p {
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  line-height: 1.9;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}

.mission-text strong {
  color: var(--laterite-red);
}

.mission-stats {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 1.5rem;
  position: sticky;
  top: 6rem;
}

.stat-card {
  background: var(--bg-alt);
  padding: 2rem;
  border-radius: 15px;
  text-align: center;
  border-left: 5px solid var(--laterite-red);
}

.stat-number {
  font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
  font-size: 4rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--laterite-red);
  line-height: 1;
}

.stat-label {
  font-size: 1.2rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--laterite-dark);
  margin-top: 0.5rem;
}

.stat-detail {
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  margin-top: 0.5rem;
}

/* Responsive */
@media (max-width: 968px) {
  .mission-content {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .mission-stats {
    position: static;
    flex-direction: row;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .support-hero h1 {
    font-size: 3rem;
  }

  .mission-stats {
    flex-direction: column;
  }
}
</style>
